<title>FINLAND: HARTWALL SAYS COCA-COLA TALKS EXTENDED.</title>
<headline>HARTWALL SAYS COCA-COLA TALKS EXTENDED.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish beverage group Oy Hartwall Ab said on Friday its talks with Coca-Cola on production, sales and distribution of Coca-Cola products in Finland had been extended beyond the original March 15 deadline.</p>
<p>&quot;Discussions between Oy Hartwall Ab and The Coca-Cola Company regarding future cooperation will continue beyond the previously announced deadline, March 15,&quot; Hartwall said.</p>
<p>&quot;The companies will ensure the continued bottling, sales and distribution of products of The Coca-Cola Company through Oy Hartwall Ab,&quot; it said. --Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
